{"sha": "ca35031d0589f97dcd1f05b2f876494f130e7c3a4329e5e3970ad45be27afc1c", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g12:arith} 章 --- 算术}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:arith:1}", "$17 \\times 119 = 2023$，故 $2026 = 17 \\times 119 + 3$：商 $119$，", "余数 $3$。对 $-2026$：$-2026 = 17\\times(-120) + 14$（事实上", "$17 \\times 120 = 2040$，且 $2040 - 2026 = 14$）：商 $-120$，余数", "$14$（余数须属于 $\\intco{0}{17}$，故它\\emph{不是} $-3$）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:arith:2}", "模 $10$：$7^2 = 49 \\equiv 9 \\equiv -1$。因此", "$7^{100} = \\left(7^2\\right)^{50} \\equiv (-1)^{50} = 1 \\pmod{10}$：$7^{100}$ 的末位", "数字为 $1$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:arith:3}", "欧几里得算法：$1071 = 2\\times462 + 147$；$462 = 3\\times147 + 21$；", "$147 = 7\\times21 + 0$。故 $\\gcd = 21$。", "", "回代：$21 = 462 - 3\\times147 = 462 - 3(1071 - 2\\times462)", "= 7\\times462 - 3\\times1071$。于是 $u = -3$，$v = 7$：", "$1071\\times(-3) + 462\\times7 = 21$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:arith:4}", "每个整数都满足 $\\equiv 0, 1, 2$ 或 $3 \\pmod 4$，并计算平方：", "$0^2 \\equiv 0$，$1^2 \\equiv 1$，$2^2 = 4 \\equiv 0$，$3^2 = 9 \\equiv 1$。故", "$n^2 \\equiv 0$ 或 $1 \\pmod 4$。于是两个平方数之和同余于", "$0 + 0$、$0 + 1$ 或 $1 + 1$，\\emph{即}为 $0$、$1$ 或 $2 \\pmod 4$ ---", "决不与 $3$ 同余。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:arith:5}", "被 $2$ 整除：$n$ 与 $n + 1$ 中必有一个为偶数。被", "$3$ 整除：若 $n \\equiv 0$，则 $3 \\mid n$；若 $n \\equiv 1 \\pmod 3$，则", "$2n + 1 \\equiv 3 \\equiv 0$；若 $n \\equiv 2$，则 $n + 1 \\equiv 0$。于是各情形下", "$3$ 整除该乘积。由于 $\\gcd(2,3) = 1$，", "由\\cref{cor:g12:arith:coprimeprod}可得 $6 \\mid n(n+1)(2n+1)$。", "（这也重新证明了 $\\frac{n(n+1)(2n+1)}{6}$，即", "\\cref{exo:g12:seq:1}中的平方和，是整数。）", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:arith:6}", "求 $5$ 模 $11$ 的逆元：试算（或用贝祖等式）", "$5 \\times 9 = 45 = 44 + 1 \\equiv 1 \\pmod{11}$。将该同余式两边乘以", "$9$：", "\\[", "x \\equiv 9 \\times 3 = 27 \\equiv 5 \\pmod{11}.", "\\]", "所有解为整数 $x = 5 + 11k$，$k \\in \\Z$。（验算：", "$5\\times5 = 25 \\equiv 3 \\pmod{11}$。）", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:arith:7}", "$\\gcd(17, 40) = 1$，故解存在。欧几里得算法：", "$40 = 2\\times17 + 6$；$17 = 2\\times6 + 5$；$6 = 5 + 1$。回代：", "$1 = 6 - 5 = 6 - (17 - 2\\times6) = 3\\times6 - 17", "= 3(40 - 2\\times17) - 17 = 3\\times40 - 7\\times17$。因此", "$17\\times(-7) - 40\\times(-3) = 1$，故特解", "为 $(x_0, y_0) = (-7, -3)$。", "", "方程 $17x - 40y = 1$ 的通解：将特解关系式相减，", "$17(x + 7) = 40(y + 3)$；由于 $\\gcd(17, 40) = 1$，由高斯引理可得", "$40 \\mid x + 7$，故 $x = -7 + 40k$，进而 $y = -3 + 17k$，$k \\in \\Z$", "（经验证均成立）。", "", "对于 $17x - 40y = 6$，将特解乘以 $6$：", "$(x_1, y_1) = (-42, -18)$，同理可得", "\\[", "x = -42 + 40k, \\qquad y = -18 + 17k, \\qquad k \\in \\Z .", "\\]", "（例如 $k = 2$：$x = 38$，$y = 16$；事实上 $17\\times38 - 40\\times16", "= 646 - 640 = 6$。）", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:arith:8}", "设 $\\sqrt2 = \\frac ab$，其中 $a, b \\in \\N^*$，则 $a^2 = 2b^2$。在", "平方数的质因数分解中，每个指数都是偶数，故", "$2$ 在 $a^2$ 中的指数为偶数，而在 $2b^2$ 中为奇数（比某个偶数多一）。同一整数的两个", "质因数分解中 $2$ 的指数不同，", "与\\cref{thm:g12:arith:fta}的唯一性相矛盾。因此", "不存在这样的分数：$\\sqrt2 \\notin \\Q$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:arith:9}", "\\emph{1.} 由 $k\\binom pk = p \\binom{p-1}{k-1}$，$p$ 整除", "$k\\binom pk$。对 $1 \\leq k \\leq p-1$，$p \\nmid k$，且 $p$ 为质数，于是", "$\\gcd(p, k) = 1$，由高斯引理可得 $p \\mid \\binom pk$。", "", "\\emph{2.} 对 $a$ 作归纳。当 $a = 0$ 时，$0^p \\equiv 0$。假设", "$a^p \\equiv a \\pmod p$。由二项式定理，", "\\[", "(a+1)^p = \\sum_{k=0}^{p} \\binom pk a^k", "\\equiv a^p + 1 \\pmod p,", "\\]", "由第 1 小题，中间各项模 $p$ 均消失。由归纳", "假设，$(a+1)^p \\equiv a + 1 \\pmod p$。这就证明了", "$a^p \\equiv a$ 对所有 $a \\in \\N$ 成立，而 $a < 0$ 的情形由", "$a \\equiv a + kp$（取适当的正代表元）即得。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:arith:10}", "$n \\equiv 2 \\pmod 3$ 且 $n \\equiv 3 \\pmod 5$：记 $n = 2 + 3s$，则", "$2 + 3s \\equiv 3 \\pmod 5$，\\emph{即} $3s \\equiv 1 \\pmod 5$。", "$3$ 模 $5$ 的逆元为 $2$（$3\\times2 = 6 \\equiv 1$），故 $s \\equiv 2 \\pmod 5$，", "记 $s = 2 + 5t$，于是 $n = 8 + 15t$。前两个条件即", "$n \\equiv 8 \\pmod{15}$。", "", "再加上 $n \\equiv 2 \\pmod 7$：$8 + 15t \\equiv 2 \\pmod 7$，且", "$15 \\equiv 1 \\pmod 7$，故 $t \\equiv -6 \\equiv 1 \\pmod 7$，记", "$t = 1 + 7u$。因此 $n = 23 + 105u$：", "\\[", "n \\equiv 23 \\pmod{105}.", "\\]", "（验算：$23 = 3\\times7 + 2 = 5\\times4 + 3 = 7\\times3 + 2$。）", "\\end{solution}", ""]}